## Scope of this license

This MIT license applies only to the original source code of this
repository (Astro/Svelte/TypeScript application logic, build scripts,
styles).

It does NOT apply to game data and assets derived from Mutants Genetic
Gladiators, including but not limited to the contents of `src/data/`,
`public/mutants/`, `public/materials/`, `public/buildings/`, and any other
game-sourced text, numbers, images, or textures anywhere in this
repository or its build output. All such content is the property of its
respective rights holders (Kobojo / Celsius Online) and is used here
without claim of ownership, for non-commercial fan-project purposes only
(a reference wiki and gameplay simulators for the game's community).

This repository is an independent, unofficial fan project and is not
affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by Kobojo or Celsius Online.
